{"articleNo":"224853","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=224853&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교외행사] 2019년 삼성SDI 'We Dream School' 주중교실 강사 선발 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2019.05.18","hit":"11129","attachments":[{"name":"We Dream School 강사 선발 안내문.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=224853&attachNo=79855"},{"name":"We Dream School 강사 지원서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=224853&attachNo=79856"},{"name":"개인정보 수집 이용 동의서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=224853&attachNo=79857"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&lt;2019년 삼성SDI&nbsp;'We Dream School' 주중교실 강사 선발 안내</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&gt;</span></strong></strong></span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">삼성SDI&nbsp;'We Dream School'은 구미지역 내 교육 환경이 열악한 지역아동센터 초등학생에게 </span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">대학생 강사를 통한 영어수업을 진행하여 </span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">꿈과 희망을 심어주고, <span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">어학능력 향상에 도움을 주고자 운영하는 프로그램입니다.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">주중 영어교실에 참여해 초등학생들에게 영어를 가르칠 대학생 강사를 선발하오니 많은 지원 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></span></span></strong></strong></span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">1. 선발인원 : 10명(재학생, 학기초과자 제외)</span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">2. 서류접수</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; - 기간 : 2019.5.20.(월) 오전 9시~5.31.(금) 오후 1시 마감</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; - 방법 :&nbsp;'We Dream School' 담당자에게 '강사지원서' 및 제출서류 메일 발송</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; - 세부사항 : 붙임 참조</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">3. 활동</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; - 기간<span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"> : 2019.6.17.(월)~2019.12.20.(수), 27주간</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><spa